seg-2f06a8b277b7 = Report it privately, by either route:

# text
seg-31999fe1b838 = <b>GitHub private vulnerability reporting</b> — the <em>Report a vulnerability</em> button on the repository's <a1>Security tab</a1>. The report is visible only to the maintainers, and a fix can be prepared in a private fork and published as a GitHub Security Advisory.

# text
seg-7bdcc2ffe39e = <b>Email</b> — <b><a1>contact@ashforde.org</a1></b>, with details and reproduction steps.

# text
seg-fbc3db22c061 = Please do not open a public issue for security-sensitive reports. We aim to acknowledge within a few business days.

